Oil just fell to a three-month low after the US and Iran signed a peace framework in Geneva and Washington issued a 60-day license for Iran to sell oil internationally. If you built up Canadian energy exposure earlier this year on the Hormuz disruption story, this is the moment that trade is actually being tested.<br><br>
I would be glad to walk through how I am thinking about position sizing here, with no obligation.<br><br>
